[4.425, "o", "### 药方 1：更新导入路径 ✅ 推荐\r\n"]
[4.485, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.545, "o", "**适用版本**: `langchain >= 0.3.0`\r\n"]
[4.605, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.665, "o", "1. 安装独立的 OpenAI 集成包：\r\n"]
[4.725, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.785, "o", "```bash\r\n"]
[4.845, "o", "pip install langchain-openai\r\n"]
